 the comedy and  the drama and the ridiculousness of  situations and people and characters and  you know the darkness of the story as  well so yeah I guess this film might  might have more of a funny aspect to it  then you know some of my other films but  the darkness comes as well Oh 100% sir I  say again one of the best films of the  year thank you thank you so much for  your time  you
 

